  "description": "Kwak Eun-Ho has spent 11 years as Ji Hyeon’s friend and 7 years as his manager, all the while hiding his huge crush for him. But his secret partially comes to light when the two of them shoot a variety show called “Check Out My Manager,” and Eun-Ho drops a bombshell during the interview: “There is someone I’m interested in.” This greatly irks Hyeon, who believes there is someone in Eun-Ho’s life that he doesn’t know about. But that “someone” would have been so obvious if only Hyeon could have checked out his manager just a little more...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
